Subject: [PATCH 15/20] lib: mobile adjustment in cjs module loader
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Co-authored-by: Andre Staltz <andre@staltz.com>
